DESCRIPTION:Meet at 10 AM for breakfast at The Loop. Ride departure time wi
 ll be announced when the schedule is settled. Dress festive and bring a ne
 w\, unwrapped toy for kids in need. We plan to donate the gifts to The Sal
 vation Army. Come alone or bring a friend. The brewery-to-brewery ride con
 tinues through the afternoon. Brewery stops, the final brewery, and the to
 y collection location will be announced closer to ride day. The calendar b
 locks time through 5:30 PM as an estimate; the actual finish time may vary
 .\n\nWebsite and ride updates: https://scrmsp.org\n\nFacebook RSVP (option
 al but appreciated): https://www.facebook.com/events/1972798296683555/\n\n
